{"id":72971,"date":"2026-11-07T06:40:05","date_gmt":"2026-11-07T06:40:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72971"},"modified":"2026-11-07T07:43:40","modified_gmt":"2026-11-07T06:43:40","slug":"el-privilegio-100-millas","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/el-privilegio-100-millas\/","title":{"rendered":"El Privilegio 100 Millas 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">El Privilegio 100 Millas 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>El Privilegio 100 Millas 2026<\/strong> realiza-se de <strong>20 a 22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, entre as prov\u00edncias de <strong>Toledo e Ciudad Real<\/strong>, na regi\u00e3o de Castela-La Mancha, em <strong>Espanha<\/strong>. Organizada pelo <strong>Club Deportivo Runin926<\/strong>, esta prova de ultra-endurance percorre a rota hist\u00f3rica do antigo correio real (<em>Camino del Antiguo Correo Real<\/em>), ligando o Castelo de Montalb\u00e1n \/ Santa Mar\u00eda de Melque (Toledo) \u00e0 emblem\u00e1tica Puerta de Toledo, em Ciudad Real.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa competitivo divide-se em tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias principais disputadas em regime de semi-autossufici\u00eancia e navega\u00e7\u00e3o obrigat\u00f3ria por GPS (percurso n\u00e3o balizado fisicamente): a prova rainha <strong>100 Millas (174 km e +2.500 m D+)<\/strong> com partida na sexta-feira \u00e0s 20h00 em Santa Mar\u00eda de Melque (tempo limite de 38 a 40 horas), as <strong>50 Millas (84 km e +1.150 m D+)<\/strong> com partida no s\u00e1bado \u00e0s 10h00 em Santa Quiteria \/ Alcoba de los Montes (tempo limite de 20 horas) e as <strong>6 Leguas (30 km e +480 m D+)<\/strong> com limite de 6 horas, incluindo ainda categorias de <strong>Marcha N\u00f3rdica<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Devido \u00e0s condi\u00e7\u00f5es meteorol\u00f3gicas rigorosas de final de outono e \u00e0 travessia noturna por zonas remotas, o regulamento exige equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio de seguran\u00e7a (manta t\u00e9rmica, casaco imperme\u00e1vel com capuz, frontal com bateria suplente, reserva m\u00ednima de 1 litro de \u00e1gua, telem\u00f3vel e copo reutiliz\u00e1vel), fornecendo geolocaliza\u00e7\u00e3o por baliza GPS em tempo real a todos os atletas. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template