Toledo) \u00e0 Puerta de Toledo, em Ciudad Real (Castela-La Mancha, Espanha).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra as 100 Millas (174 km com +2.500 m D+, partida a 20 de novembro \u00e0s 20h00), as 50 Millas (84 km com +1.150 m D+, partida a 21 de novembro \u00e0s 10h00 em Santa Quiteria) e as 6 Leguas (30 km com +480 m D+), al\u00e9m de vertentes de Marcha N\u00f3rdica.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o por fases?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Nas 100 Millas, os valores s\u00e3o de 110 \u20ac (at\u00e9 31 de maio), 125 \u20ac (junho a agosto) e 140 \u20ac (a partir de setembro). Nas 50 Millas, variam entre 70 \u20ac, 80 \u20ac e 90 \u20ac. Na prova de 6 Leguas (30 km), custam 25 \u20ac, 30 \u20ac e 35 \u20ac consoante a fase de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona a navega\u00e7\u00e3o e que material \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova disputa-se em regime de semi-autossufici\u00eancia sem balizagem f\u00edsica cont\u00ednua, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio seguir o track GPX oficial num rel\u00f3gio ou dispositivo GPS, al\u00e9m de transportar baliza de geolocaliza\u00e7\u00e3o, manta t\u00e9rmica, imperme\u00e1vel com capuz, frontal com bateria extra, apito, telem\u00f3vel e reserva m\u00ednima de 1 litro de \u00e1gua.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a entidade organizadora e onde consultar o regulamento oficial?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo do Club Deportivo Runin926 e toda a regulamenta\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica, bases de vida e tracks podem ser consultados no portal oficial elprivilegio100millas.com.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"El Privilegio 100 Millas 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-20\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-20\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Toledo a Ciudad Real, Espanha\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Ciudad Real\", \"addressRegion\": \"Espanha\", \"addressCountry\": \"ES\"}}, \"description\": \"O El Privilegio 100 Millas 2026 realiza-se de 20 a 22 de novembro entr